# Source databases and large derived files are NOT versioned: they weigh several GB and have
# different licences (LIPID MAPS, ChEBI CC BY, COCONUT, RefMet, GNPS, MassBank CC BY-SA, HMDB).
# They are downloaded by hand and regenerated by the scripts; see data/README.md.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/MANIFEST.csv
!data/download_data.sh
!data/NIST/
!data/HMDB/
data/HMDB/raw/
data/HMDB/hmdb_formula_taxonomy.csv

